# Society Maintenance Tracker - environment variables
# This demo runs entirely client-side, so no environment variables are required
# for the basic experience. All state is persisted in the browser's localStorage.
#
# When wiring this to a real backend, you would typically need:
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
# VITE_EMAIL_PROVIDER_KEY=re_xxx   # transactional email API key
# VITE_STORAGE_BUCKET=society-photos
